# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-language-not-available = Iste discargamento de { -brand-name-firefox } ab { $partner } non es disponibile in tu lingua. Tu pote ancora discargar { -brand-name-firefox } per le button infra.
# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-device-not-available = Iste discargamento de { -brand-name-firefox } ab { $partner } non es disponibile pro tu apparato. Tu pote ancora discargar { -brand-name-firefox } per le button infra.
# firefox.com is a web address. Don’t translate it.
partner-download-already-using-firefox = Tu usa jam { -brand-name-firefox }. Continua sur firefox.com pro vider cosas nove.
# firefox.com is a web address. Don’t translate it.
partner-download-continue = Continuar a firefox.com
# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
